{"kind":"article","metadata":{"title":"Logging","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"NoughtyTours SDK"}],"role":"article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK logs for itself. Every line goes to its ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"log file"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" on the device — always, down to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"debug","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — and the lines at or above ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/Log\/level","type":"reference"},{"text":" are also printed to the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"console"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" through","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"os.Logger","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (subsystem ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.thenoughtyfox.noughtytours","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), prefixed so they are yours to spot and to grep:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["[NoughtyToursSDK] floor upload failed: network unavailable"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"One knob, and it is the whole API:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ Anywhere — this needs no ``NoughtyTours``, so `didFinishLaunchingWithOptions` is a good place.","Log.level = .info    \/\/ .debug .info .notice (default) .error .off"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"There is deliberately ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"no log stream to subscribe to"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". A host that forwarded the SDK’s lines into","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its own logger printed every one of them twice — once from the SDK, once from the host — which is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"worse than either alone. Set the level; if you need the lines as data, take the log file.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"The log file","anchor":"The-log-file"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Documents\/Logs\/capture-runtime.log","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", one line per entry, ignoring ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/Log\/level","type":"reference"},{"text":" entirely:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["ts=1761134502.184 | sync.upload | ERROR | [bg-4f1a] floor upload failed: network unavailable"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Timestamp, category, level, thread, message. It is the SDK’s postmortem — attach it to a bug report","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the trace is complete even if the console was quiet. The SDK appends to it and never rotates it,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so a host that keeps long-lived installs should delete it when it collects one.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Categories","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Categories"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The category is the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"os.Logger"},{"type":"text","text":" category (so it is what you filter on in Console.app) and the second"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"column in the log file:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","alignments":["left","left"],"type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Category"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What it covers"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/LogCategory\/captureFlow","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"capture sessions starting, finishing, tearing down"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/LogCategory\/captureStructure","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"structure capture — the floor plan being built"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/LogCategory\/captureRelocalization","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"relocalizing against a floor captured earlier","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/LogCategory\/captureMedia","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"camera, video recording, motion data"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/LogCategory\/syncUpload","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"sync and background uploads — ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"start here when a capture never arrives","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/LogCategory\/auth","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"App Attest attestation, assertion, the org-scoped bearer","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Worth knowing","anchor":"Worth-knowing"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set it before you build the SDK.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" The level is process-wide and needs no ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/NoughtyTours","isActive":true},{"text":", which is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"point: uploads continue after your app is suspended and iOS may relaunch the process to finish","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them, so the most interesting lines are emitted before ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/NoughtyTours\/start()","type":"reference"},{"text":" has returned.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/Log\/level","isActive":true},{"text":" filters the console only.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" The log file always gets every line, so lowering","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the level costs you nothing in a bug report. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/LogLevel\/off","type":"reference"},{"text":" silences the console and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"leaves the file untouched.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It is writable at any time, from any thread.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" A change applies to the next line the SDK emits.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Messages are diagnostics, not API.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" Their wording changes between versions — never parse them,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exactly as with ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/NoughtyToursError","type":"reference"},{"text":"’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"reason","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" strings.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The capture engine keeps its own low-level output.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" Frame and mesh internals go straight to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"os.Logger","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and do not pass through ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/Log","type":"reference"},{"text":"; Console.app still sees them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"See what the SDK is doing, at the verbosity you choose."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/noughtytourssdk\/logging"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/Logging"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Related-Documentation","title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/Log","doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/LogLevel","doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/LogCategory","doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/HandlingErrors"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Diagnostics","title":"Diagnostics","identifiers":["doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/Log","doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/LogLevel","doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/LogCategory"]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK/documentation/NoughtyToursSDK/LogCategory":{"fragments":